OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening with clear spells, especially
OL,7,Fin the east. Cloudier over western
OL,8,Fhills, with perhaps the odd isolated
OL,9,Fshower. It will turn chilly, with a
OL,10,Frisk of grass frost and perhaps some
OL,11,Fmist and fog in rural areas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA fine and dry day with
OL,14,Fsunny spells, especially in the east.
OL,15,FCloudier over western hills, with a
OL,16,Fsmall chance of an isolated shower.
OL,17,FFeeling pleasantly warm through the
OL,18,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
